WEBVTT

00:48.882 --> 00:50.258
JEONG SE-YEON'S DIRTY LAUNDRY

00:50.341 --> 00:51.843
WAS NSIX'S JEONG SE-YEON A BULLY?

00:54.554 --> 00:55.764
MANY VICTIMS COME FORWARD

00:56.681 --> 00:58.725
MR. A CLAIMS,
"I WAS BULLIED BY SE-YEON FOR THREE YEARS"

01:01.019 --> 01:02.562
LEE SOO-HO

01:05.106 --> 01:06.858
The person you are trying to reach is…

01:12.447 --> 01:16.034
- Any words to the victims' families?
- Is it true about your contract?

01:16.117 --> 01:19.746
- Any words for your disappointed fans?
- Any response to the rumors?

01:19.829 --> 01:22.665
- Please say something!
- A comment, please!

01:22.749 --> 01:23.833
Where are you going?

01:26.127 --> 01:27.337
To Soo-ho.

01:27.420 --> 01:28.755
What?

01:29.255 --> 01:30.757
Soo-ho will believe me.

01:30.840 --> 01:31.883
And if he believes me,

01:33.259 --> 01:35.053
Mr. Lee will hear me out.

01:35.136 --> 01:37.931
- Then let me come with you.
- A word for your victims, please!

01:38.014 --> 01:41.017
- Mr. Jeong Se-yeon!
- Say something to your fans!

01:41.100 --> 01:43.728
FUNERAL HOME

01:53.029 --> 01:54.614
Se-yeon.

01:57.534 --> 01:58.618
Se-yeon.

02:08.628 --> 02:10.880
THE LATE JEONG SE-YEON

02:40.660 --> 02:41.995
I'm sorry.

02:46.916 --> 02:48.042
Hey, Lee Soo-ho.

02:49.919 --> 02:51.212
You got a friend killed.

02:52.171 --> 02:53.506
Yet you seem to be doing well.

02:59.137 --> 03:00.680
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

03:21.534 --> 03:22.493
Excuse me…

03:22.994 --> 03:24.329
Is this about your helmet?

03:24.412 --> 03:25.413
Not at all.

03:26.706 --> 03:27.916
I'm having lunch with you.

03:35.173 --> 03:36.257
Han Seo-jun!

03:48.019 --> 03:49.437
Seriously, you punk?

04:21.844 --> 04:23.054
Punch me.

04:23.888 --> 04:25.556
Go ahead, punch me.

04:25.640 --> 04:26.849
Hey!

04:28.851 --> 04:30.478
What are you two doing over there?

04:33.022 --> 04:34.190
Break it off!

04:47.453 --> 04:48.413
Han Seo-jun,

04:49.080 --> 04:50.164
what are you thinking?

04:51.791 --> 04:54.294
After all that hassle,
you quit that boy band.

04:54.377 --> 04:56.713
Now, are you trying to become a gangster?

04:56.796 --> 04:59.924
What kind of student has a fight
on sacred school property?

05:00.008 --> 05:01.092
You're right, sir.

05:01.175 --> 05:02.635
I was so shocked.

05:03.219 --> 05:05.305
They punched each other
in front of my eyes.

05:05.388 --> 05:07.307
I almost snorted rice out of my nostrils.

05:07.390 --> 05:09.225
- Go back to your class, you!
- Yes, sir.

05:09.726 --> 05:10.935
See you later.

05:12.854 --> 05:14.439
What if we have to hold a hearing?

05:14.522 --> 05:16.024
Do you want to get expelled?

05:16.107 --> 05:17.567
I started it.

05:17.650 --> 05:19.319
Gosh, Soo-ho.

05:19.402 --> 05:22.405
Why would you protect him?

05:23.990 --> 05:26.075
You even took time off
to care for your mother,

05:26.159 --> 05:27.869
but what a sight you are now.

05:29.120 --> 05:31.205
How can a mother not get sick

05:31.289 --> 05:34.917
when her son acts out like this?

05:35.001 --> 05:37.211
Sir, please stop.

05:37.295 --> 05:39.172
My goodness.

05:39.255 --> 05:42.884
Since Soo-ho said
he'll kindly forgive him,

05:42.967 --> 05:44.260
let's wrap things up here.

05:44.343 --> 05:48.097
We don't need to raise a ruckus
about school violence, now do we?

05:53.394 --> 05:56.272
Soo-ho, you have a Math Olympiad
the day after tomorrow.

05:56.355 --> 05:58.107
You should take care of yourself.

05:58.191 --> 06:00.068
Go ahead. You may leave.

06:12.622 --> 06:13.456
What's this?

06:14.290 --> 06:16.209
Why are you glaring like that?

06:16.292 --> 06:18.461
- This punk--
- Please sir, stop.

06:19.295 --> 06:21.214
Aren't you going to say you're sorry?

06:25.760 --> 06:26.719
Are you all right?

06:27.386 --> 06:28.471
You're hurt.

06:31.224 --> 06:34.060
Why didn't you get beaten up
and get your arm broken?

06:34.143 --> 06:36.562
Then I'd win the Math Olympiad, right?

06:37.438 --> 06:38.856
Leave if you're here to ramble.

06:39.482 --> 06:43.027
You should have thrown him
to the ground while you were at it.

06:43.111 --> 06:46.030
That way, he won't try anything
with you ever again.

06:46.114 --> 06:47.990
You really learned jiu-jitsu for nothing.

06:48.491 --> 06:51.285
You haven't changed a bit.
You're still a giant pushover.

06:52.245 --> 06:54.622
Seriously, what happened between you two?

06:55.248 --> 06:56.916
Is it because of Jeong Se-yeon?

06:59.961 --> 07:00.878
Hey,

07:01.629 --> 07:02.463
put this on.

07:08.845 --> 07:10.680
They say the two towers fought over her.

07:10.763 --> 07:12.140
Is it a love triangle?

07:12.223 --> 07:13.057
This is huge.

07:14.142 --> 07:16.102
- What happened?
- So what was it about?

07:16.185 --> 07:18.271
Seriously, what's happening?

07:18.354 --> 07:21.482
Ju-kyung, I heard both Lee Soo-ho
and Han Seo-jun like you.

07:21.566 --> 07:24.110
Who are you going to pick between the two?

07:28.114 --> 07:29.323
There's nothing to choose.

07:34.745 --> 07:37.790
Will it be Savior Soo-ho
or Seo-jun Almighty?

07:38.499 --> 07:40.293
Who will you pick?

07:40.376 --> 07:41.294
- Who's your pick?
- Who's your pick?

07:41.377 --> 07:44.172
Hey, why don't you just pick ATEEN
on the music programs?

07:44.255 --> 07:45.506
Are you a fan too?

07:45.590 --> 07:46.841
It's not like that.

07:46.924 --> 07:49.218
There's no way
the two towers would like me.

07:49.302 --> 07:51.095
I hear they don't get along. That's why.

07:51.179 --> 07:53.014
- No way!
- No!

07:53.097 --> 07:54.307
- It can't be.
- No way.

07:56.267 --> 07:57.435
By the way,

07:57.518 --> 08:02.648
why did Mr. H sit next to Ms. L?

08:02.732 --> 08:04.525
- That's what I like to know--
- Hey.

08:04.609 --> 08:07.862
- You need to stop it.
- Let's leave it at that.

08:07.945 --> 08:09.447
- Hey!
- That was perfect reasoning.

08:09.530 --> 08:11.449
If Ju-kyung says no, then that's it.

08:11.532 --> 08:12.492
Go back to your classes.

08:12.575 --> 08:14.160
- Return to your seats.
- Agreed!

08:14.243 --> 08:15.244
But why?

08:15.328 --> 08:16.704
You guys all leave too!

08:17.538 --> 08:18.706
- Su-ah says so.
- Hey.

08:18.789 --> 08:20.458
- Go.
- What class do we have next?

08:20.541 --> 08:23.127
All this trouble
because you're too pretty.

08:23.211 --> 08:27.715
If it was an average girl instead of you,
there would be no such rumors.

08:27.798 --> 08:29.217
Goodness. It must be tiring.

08:31.802 --> 08:33.387
Seriously, what was all that?

08:35.306 --> 08:38.100
In this sense, maybe I did have it easy
when I went unnoticed.

08:38.184 --> 08:40.102
- Hey, Soo-ho's back.
- Soo-ho is here.

08:40.186 --> 08:42.688
- What happened, Soo-ho?
- What's going on?

08:50.488 --> 08:51.572
Hey, Soo-ho!

08:54.450 --> 08:56.035
Come see me outside.

08:58.204 --> 08:59.205
Hey, Soo-ho.

09:00.915 --> 09:03.000
Who are you
to start something with Seo-jun?

09:03.084 --> 09:04.669
What an elegant jerk.

09:04.752 --> 09:06.837
- Arrogant.
- Arrogant.

09:06.921 --> 09:08.214
- He's right.
- Is it arrogant?

09:08.297 --> 09:09.799
Anyway.

09:09.882 --> 09:12.760
What will you do
if Seo-jun gets suspended because of you?

09:12.843 --> 09:15.263
You grabbed him first,
so wasn't that first defense?

09:15.346 --> 09:17.515
- Self-defense.
- He's right.

09:17.598 --> 09:18.432
He's correct.

09:18.516 --> 09:20.184
Are you pretending to be a gangster?

09:21.561 --> 09:23.187
Where do you think you're going?

09:26.357 --> 09:27.692
You're crossing the line.

09:31.195 --> 09:33.489
- He's crossing the line.
- Don't hold him back.

09:36.993 --> 09:38.828
- What should we do?
- Do you work out?

09:39.328 --> 09:40.705
Jump in you guys!

09:40.788 --> 09:42.748
- Got it.
- Come on, jump in.

09:44.041 --> 09:44.959
Seriously?

09:47.753 --> 09:48.713
That's enough.

09:53.009 --> 09:55.886
Am I a pig up for the roast?

09:59.307 --> 10:00.224
You little punks!

10:01.475 --> 10:02.768
Are you acting up again?

10:03.352 --> 10:04.770
- It's not what it seems.
- Sorry, sir.

10:04.854 --> 10:05.855
Silence!

10:05.938 --> 10:08.024
Kim Cho-rong, that meddling idiot.

10:09.984 --> 10:13.195
You little punks, hanging out together
and always up to no good!

10:14.071 --> 10:16.866
- We were just exercising…
- Exercising? Look at your body!

10:18.826 --> 10:19.660
- Gosh.
- Hey.

10:20.745 --> 10:21.579
Pass the ball.

10:24.206 --> 10:25.166
Hey, Soo-ho.

10:25.666 --> 10:27.668
I was worried you might die by my punch,

10:27.752 --> 10:29.170
so I went easy on you. Got it?

10:30.421 --> 10:32.840
- I seriously…
- I don't think he can hear you.

10:33.758 --> 10:35.134
I'll go and relay the message.

10:35.217 --> 10:37.094
- Hey, Soo-ho!
- Hey, Man-sik!

10:39.764 --> 10:42.308
My neck is cramping!

10:42.391 --> 10:44.477
- My neck is cramping!
- Hurry up, come on.

10:44.560 --> 10:46.896
- Take him to the nurse.
- Call 911.

10:49.023 --> 10:49.857
Hello?

10:51.692 --> 10:52.652
Seo-jun.

10:56.447 --> 10:57.823
What do you want from me?

10:58.449 --> 10:59.325
What do I want?

11:01.035 --> 11:02.328
Stay out of my sight.

11:03.454 --> 11:05.373
You stay away if you don't want to see me.

11:05.956 --> 11:07.958
I have no reason to run from you.

11:09.001 --> 11:10.252
You're so shameless.

11:12.129 --> 11:12.963
I see.

11:13.798 --> 11:15.049
That's your true nature.

11:17.760 --> 11:18.719
That night…

11:22.348 --> 11:23.682
when Se-yeon came to see me…

11:26.852 --> 11:27.686
What now?

11:33.526 --> 11:35.236
Making excuses after all these years?

11:37.238 --> 11:38.739
Do you have any idea…

11:39.865 --> 11:41.659
what his final words to me were?

11:43.327 --> 11:44.245
"Soo-ho…

11:45.579 --> 11:46.580
will believe me."

11:48.833 --> 11:51.502
He didn't know
how cold and selfish you really are.

11:54.296 --> 11:56.715
He had faith in you, so he ran to you.

11:59.927 --> 12:01.554
So don't you ever…

12:02.888 --> 12:04.515
mention Se-yeon's name again.

12:44.472 --> 12:45.848
Bring Se-yeon back.

12:47.725 --> 12:49.185
Bring him back!

12:50.186 --> 12:53.272
Bring back Se-yeon, you bastard!

13:19.048 --> 13:22.301
PRINCE COMICS

13:30.726 --> 13:32.770
RESERVED FOR LIM JU-KYUNG.
SIT HERE AND YOU'LL GROW BUTT HAIR.

13:48.494 --> 13:49.662
Are you crying?

13:49.745 --> 13:50.829
CURSED MASK

13:57.127 --> 14:00.005
Did the book scare you that much?

14:02.466 --> 14:04.051
It's okay. Don't cry.

14:04.760 --> 14:06.554
This isn't scary at…

14:06.637 --> 14:08.305
Squirrel.

14:08.389 --> 14:10.349
I'm a squirrel.

14:12.017 --> 14:13.185
Seriously, you're not going to…

14:13.269 --> 14:18.148
Meow.

14:20.359 --> 14:21.402
You finally smiled.

14:21.485 --> 14:24.363
Squirrel. I'm a squirrel.

14:25.447 --> 14:26.615
Did you know?

14:26.699 --> 14:29.618
You'll grow butt hair
if you cry and then smile!

14:30.619 --> 14:34.498
Squirrel. I'm a squirrel.

14:36.709 --> 14:37.751
Soo-ho.

14:40.254 --> 14:42.756
I was passing by and saw you were in here.

14:44.592 --> 14:46.427
Here, drink this.

14:49.221 --> 14:51.265
I saw Seo-jun leave school earlier.

14:51.348 --> 14:53.434
Did you clean the gym all by yourself?

14:54.143 --> 14:56.395
And you just let him go?

14:56.478 --> 14:58.898
Why did you get into a fistfight
like a bunch of kids?

15:01.358 --> 15:02.318
Never mind.

15:02.860 --> 15:04.945
I wrestled with my brother
only a few days ago.

15:05.029 --> 15:05.905
I'm one to talk.

15:06.697 --> 15:08.324
I fight daily too.

15:12.786 --> 15:14.997
By the way, when my brother and I fight,

15:15.080 --> 15:17.458
my mom makes us do this one thing
to patch things up.

15:19.877 --> 15:21.045
"I love you."

15:22.171 --> 15:23.797
We say that repeatedly,

15:24.381 --> 15:25.591
and then clip,

15:26.133 --> 15:26.967
clip.

15:28.427 --> 15:30.930
- We have to trim each other's toenails.
- Toenails?

15:31.680 --> 15:33.390
When we trim each other's toenails,

15:33.474 --> 15:36.101
it tickles and stuff,
which naturally eases the mood.

15:42.441 --> 15:43.692
Did you just smile?

15:45.527 --> 15:47.279
This is my first time seeing you smile.

15:47.363 --> 15:49.323
No, I didn't smile.

15:52.368 --> 15:54.620
I'm not sure what happened before,

15:54.703 --> 15:58.290
but if you feel like talking to someone,
let me know.

15:58.374 --> 16:00.292
I can be the secret wall you can talk to.

16:03.671 --> 16:05.798
Anything for the Savior Soo-ho.

16:05.881 --> 16:07.925
What? "Savior Soo-ho"?

16:08.550 --> 16:11.011
They call you the savior of Saebom High.

16:11.804 --> 16:14.431
- You didn't know? Savior Soo-ho?
- I'm hardly a savior.

16:15.933 --> 16:17.267
Don't call me that.

16:17.351 --> 16:20.354
Why not? You are Savior Soo-ho to me too.

16:21.313 --> 16:23.691
You're my savior
for keeping my true face a secret.

16:36.704 --> 16:38.038
Does it bother you that much?

16:39.373 --> 16:40.249
What does?

16:41.417 --> 16:42.584
Your face without makeup.

16:43.919 --> 16:46.714
Don't all girls look different
with makeup on?

16:47.423 --> 16:49.717
You can't ever say that somewhere else.

16:49.800 --> 16:52.970
I look especially different,
like total opposites.

16:54.471 --> 16:56.557
Beats me. I can't tell.

17:00.310 --> 17:02.646
Are your eyes working?
How can you not tell?

17:03.564 --> 17:05.691
I tried so hard to study
and practice makeup.

17:05.774 --> 17:07.818
I can even turn this face around.

17:12.156 --> 17:13.699
You got your lips hurt?

17:15.826 --> 17:16.994
That looks painful.

17:28.255 --> 17:30.549
You two shouldn't read adult comics, okay?

17:35.304 --> 17:36.638
You should hurry home now.

17:36.722 --> 17:38.974
Do you know what time it is?
Hurry up and go home.

17:39.058 --> 17:40.225
It's not even eight.

17:40.309 --> 17:41.769
So hurry home to study.

17:41.852 --> 17:44.104
What sort of student visits
a comics shop at this hour?

17:44.188 --> 17:45.731
You must have bad grades.
What's your rank?

17:45.814 --> 17:46.774
You're wrong!

17:47.524 --> 17:49.610
Who comes after King Sejong?
You have three seconds.

17:49.693 --> 17:51.403
- One, two, three.
- King Gojong?

17:51.487 --> 17:52.863
You've skipped 400 years.

17:52.946 --> 17:54.782
You really don't know much, do you?

17:54.865 --> 17:56.617
- Hurry up and leave.
- Wait.

17:56.700 --> 17:57.743
Go home and study!

18:05.042 --> 18:06.752
What was I even saying?

18:18.013 --> 18:19.473
Goodness.

18:19.556 --> 18:20.933
Seriously, that's dangerous.

18:27.356 --> 18:28.649
Hey, Ju-kyung.

18:28.732 --> 18:30.442
Me? What is it?

18:30.526 --> 18:31.610
Are you seeing Soo-ho?

18:32.444 --> 18:33.362
No, I'm not.

18:34.446 --> 18:36.698
- You're not?
- No, never…

18:37.866 --> 18:38.700
No, I'm not.

18:39.827 --> 18:41.161
I can see that.

18:41.245 --> 18:42.287
Right.

18:43.664 --> 18:45.624
He can see that? See what?

18:48.627 --> 18:50.003
- What is that?
- Hey, look!

18:50.671 --> 18:53.215
- Does she have a bloody nose?
- There's blood on her nose.

18:56.093 --> 18:57.010
What is this?

18:59.888 --> 19:01.140
Lee Soo-ho

19:01.223 --> 19:03.559
I got soul, say ho

19:03.642 --> 19:05.894
Why don't you say hey-ho

19:12.901 --> 19:15.863
He never gives a high-five
no matter how hard Tae-hoon tries.

19:26.165 --> 19:28.667
This classroom is just like my acne.

19:29.418 --> 19:31.920
You never know when it'll blow up.

19:45.809 --> 19:48.312
What's taking him so long
to call me for a meal?

19:48.979 --> 19:50.147
Is he shy or something?

19:54.359 --> 19:56.028
I'll give him one more day.

19:56.778 --> 19:58.405
We have a constant function seven.

19:58.488 --> 20:01.033
If the input x becomes six,
what's the limit here?

20:01.116 --> 20:03.410
It's obviously seven,

20:03.493 --> 20:06.538
as the constant function's value
will stay at seven.

20:06.622 --> 20:10.959
Okay, who wants to come up
and solve the next one?

20:14.713 --> 20:15.923
I'm at fault for asking.

20:16.757 --> 20:19.635
The math genius couple, Soo-ho and Su-jin.

20:19.718 --> 20:21.094
Solve questions one and two.

20:21.762 --> 20:22.596
And…

20:24.598 --> 20:26.892
The transfer, Lim Ju-kyung,
you try question three.

20:26.975 --> 20:27.809
Come on up.

21:00.634 --> 21:02.970
Of course not. No way.

21:09.142 --> 21:10.936
Hey, Soo-ho.

21:11.561 --> 21:12.854
Help me out.

21:13.522 --> 21:15.232
Just the formula, please?

21:15.899 --> 21:17.234
Savior Soo-ho.

21:30.414 --> 21:32.082
As expected.

21:32.165 --> 21:35.168
You'll take first place again
this year for sure.

21:35.752 --> 21:37.838
The principal has high hopes for you.

21:37.921 --> 21:39.339
Do well, okay?

21:39.423 --> 21:42.134
Feel the pressure and do your best!

21:43.218 --> 21:46.638
It changes the whole mood
of the teachers' meeting. Got it?

21:52.352 --> 21:55.022
Right now is the limit of my despair.

21:58.483 --> 21:59.568
Ju-kyung.

22:00.110 --> 22:02.362
What's the use of peeking
at a different question?

22:04.156 --> 22:05.240
Right.

22:10.579 --> 22:12.497
Seo-jun must know how to solve this.

22:13.165 --> 22:15.709
Take Ju-kyung's place.
You come out and solve it.

22:17.085 --> 22:18.628
That's not going to work. Come up.

22:29.848 --> 22:30.766
Come on.

22:35.187 --> 22:37.564
No college would take me
if I gave up on math, right?

22:37.647 --> 22:39.649
You could make up for it
with other subjects.

22:39.733 --> 22:41.860
I don't think I'll be able
to go to college.

22:41.943 --> 22:43.361
Do you want to come to our math academy?

22:43.445 --> 22:45.989
All the smart kids,
including Su-jin and Soo-ho, go there.

22:46.073 --> 22:47.324
- Should I?
- Yes.

22:47.407 --> 22:49.201
My mom asked me to find one anyway.

22:49.284 --> 22:51.328
Come join us.
We have a study group afterward,

22:51.411 --> 22:52.621
and you can join that too.

22:52.704 --> 22:53.830
That'd be great for me.

22:53.914 --> 22:56.416
Hey, Soo-ho.
Do you want to join our study group?

22:56.500 --> 22:58.085
We have one last spot open.

22:58.710 --> 22:59.711
No.

22:59.795 --> 23:02.589
I need you to join so my mom
will agree to it without nagging.

23:02.672 --> 23:04.091
Just tell her I'm in the group.

23:04.966 --> 23:07.219
You want me to lie? Just join us.

23:09.846 --> 23:11.306
He's playing hard to get.

23:12.015 --> 23:14.935
I knew he'd be like this.
It's just the three of us and Tae-hoon.

23:15.018 --> 23:18.146
All right. We'll study together
as soon as Ju-kyung starts.

23:18.855 --> 23:21.733
I'm kicking you out
if you skip a session for a date.

23:21.817 --> 23:22.984
All right.

23:24.569 --> 23:27.364
Right, Limju, I gave the guy your number.

23:27.447 --> 23:29.199
- Already?
- Yes.

23:29.282 --> 23:30.826
He'll contact you soon.

23:30.909 --> 23:32.577
Look. He's super dreamy, right?

23:33.370 --> 23:36.623
It's his personality that matters.
Decide things after meeting him.

23:36.706 --> 23:39.042
I don't think I'm ready yet.

23:40.669 --> 23:42.921
I'm being dogged by rumors as is.
Should I just meet him?

23:43.004 --> 23:44.714
That's a great idea.

23:44.798 --> 23:47.008
He's already into you
after seeing your pictures.

23:56.726 --> 23:58.520
Hey, what…

24:00.021 --> 24:00.981
Why are you…

24:01.064 --> 24:02.149
Going to Prince Comics.

24:03.733 --> 24:05.694
You read quite a lot of comics.

24:06.361 --> 24:08.780
How do you still manage to be
at the top of the class?

24:12.576 --> 24:15.370
- Good luck with your exam tomorrow.
- I don't like sweets.

24:17.038 --> 24:17.914
I see.

24:22.252 --> 24:23.753
About that Olympiad tomorrow,

24:23.837 --> 24:26.006
the whole country's math geniuses
will be there, right?

24:26.089 --> 24:28.633
What do they test you on?
Is it like the nationwide exam?

24:28.717 --> 24:31.261
Do they ask about sets?
Like a union or an intersection?

24:31.344 --> 24:33.054
That's all you know about math, isn't it?

24:35.140 --> 24:36.349
Come on.

24:36.433 --> 24:38.268
We learned about sets in sophomore year.

24:38.351 --> 24:39.853
What's the equation of a circle?

24:41.188 --> 24:42.981
Math's my weak spot.

24:43.064 --> 24:44.357
Who comes after King Sejong?

24:45.609 --> 24:48.153
Hey, if you suddenly
throw a curve ball like that,

24:48.236 --> 24:50.447
it makes it hard
to recall the right answer.

24:50.530 --> 24:52.866
- You don't know, do you?
- No.

24:54.868 --> 24:56.369
JI WU-HYUN:
HI, IT'S JI WU-HYUN HERE

24:56.453 --> 24:57.621
The blind date guy texted me.

24:58.955 --> 25:01.416
Hi, it's Ji Wu-hyun here.
When would you like to meet?

25:02.167 --> 25:04.085
You should be studying,
not going on blind dates.

25:05.045 --> 25:07.172
I'm learning the ways of life.

25:07.255 --> 25:08.423
HI, I'M LIM JU-KYUNG

25:08.506 --> 25:09.549
And who knows?

25:09.633 --> 25:12.928
If this went well, my boyfriend
in a prestigious college would tutor me.

25:13.011 --> 25:15.513
I'll get both a boyfriend and good grades.

25:15.597 --> 25:17.390
Shall we meet tomorrow?
When's good for you?

25:17.474 --> 25:18.308
Tomorrow?

25:19.809 --> 25:21.519
Do people usually go on dates
in the evening?

25:21.603 --> 25:23.480
During daytime. When it's very bright out.

25:24.064 --> 25:25.065
I see.

25:25.857 --> 25:27.442
I like the daytime.

25:29.903 --> 25:32.280
- You're liking this too much.
- No, I'm not.

25:32.364 --> 25:35.575
This is all because you
and Seo-jun fought in front of me.

25:36.326 --> 25:37.869
It's because of those rumors.

25:37.953 --> 25:40.997
If you don't like it,
you don't have to go, do you?

25:43.500 --> 25:45.794
It's not that. I'm just nervous.

25:47.337 --> 25:48.255
Actually,

25:49.089 --> 25:51.925
this is my first time meeting a guy alone.

25:52.884 --> 25:54.678
Aren't you meeting me alone right now?

26:05.188 --> 26:08.900
Hey, how can you just grab my face
like it's a rolling pumpkin?

26:08.984 --> 26:11.236
I'm a person with eyes,
a nose, and a mouth.

26:12.529 --> 26:13.655
THEN LET'S WATCH A MOVIE

26:13.738 --> 26:16.116
I've been really wanting
to see this movie.

26:32.924 --> 26:35.051
You said you were going to Prince Comics.

26:35.677 --> 26:36.845
What's up with him?

26:37.387 --> 26:38.930
Good luck with your exam tomorrow!

26:54.571 --> 26:55.405
Mom!

26:55.488 --> 26:58.074
- Seo-jun!
- How was your checkup?

26:58.158 --> 27:01.119
Why are you here? You should
have just gone home after school.

27:01.202 --> 27:03.872
By the way, you didn't get here
on a motorcycle, right?

27:03.955 --> 27:05.332
I said I wouldn't.

27:05.999 --> 27:09.127
Mom, what brought on your endless worries?

27:10.545 --> 27:11.463
What did the doctor say?

27:11.546 --> 27:15.800
No signs of transplant rejection yet.
The numbers are good too.

27:15.884 --> 27:18.845
I was just told to take my medicine
and take good care of myself.

27:18.928 --> 27:19.846
That's a relief.

27:20.347 --> 27:22.599
Why don't we eat out today?
I can call up Go-un.

27:22.682 --> 27:24.976
Maybe next time.
I need to stop by somewhere today.

27:25.852 --> 27:26.853
Where?

27:26.936 --> 27:29.731
Why did you put these out
when the place is cluttered as is?

27:29.814 --> 27:32.609
These are the scented candles I made.

27:32.692 --> 27:34.527
Can you hand these out to your regulars?

27:34.611 --> 27:36.988
If they're well-received,
I want to try selling them.

27:37.072 --> 27:39.949
Please don't try to do anything.

27:41.326 --> 27:43.661
Goodness, I do love aromatherapy.

27:44.245 --> 27:45.830
I even only get aromatic massages.

27:46.831 --> 27:48.333
What scents do you have, Mr. Lim?

27:48.416 --> 27:51.669
This is a ylang-ylang-scented candle.

27:51.753 --> 27:55.173
It's known to relieve high blood pressure
and control estrogen effectively.

27:55.256 --> 27:57.175
- Ylang-ylang is especially…
- Leave already.

27:57.258 --> 27:58.718
Leaving already. Okay.

27:59.552 --> 28:01.012
He's so handsome.

28:01.096 --> 28:03.515
You must be happy just seeing his face.

28:04.307 --> 28:05.809
Why do you keep criticizing him?

28:05.892 --> 28:08.561
If it weren't for his face,
I would have left him already.

28:11.064 --> 28:12.232
My goodness.

28:12.315 --> 28:14.484
Now you're back to the Ju-kyung I know.

28:14.567 --> 28:16.653
I had no idea when you had your makeup on.

28:17.320 --> 28:18.363
Are you a magician?

28:20.573 --> 28:21.866
It's the Ju-kyung magic.

28:24.285 --> 28:25.829
I washed my face.
Do a facial for me, hurry.

28:25.912 --> 28:26.788
I already said no.

28:26.871 --> 28:28.206
Can't you see that I'm busy?

28:28.289 --> 28:30.583
- Go home and study.
- It doesn't take that long!

28:30.667 --> 28:31.709
Hey, Hyun-sook.

28:34.087 --> 28:36.256
Oh my, Mi-hyang!

28:39.050 --> 28:40.176
What's he doing here?

28:40.844 --> 28:42.178
I don't have makeup on.

28:46.015 --> 28:46.891
This is my son.

28:48.101 --> 28:48.935
Hello.

28:50.353 --> 28:52.063
My goodness…

28:52.605 --> 28:53.815
gracious.

28:54.524 --> 28:56.818
What made you turn out this handsome?

28:59.821 --> 29:00.989
There's my second child.

29:15.670 --> 29:17.422
Have you gone mad?

29:17.505 --> 29:18.423
What are you doing?

29:18.506 --> 29:20.008
Get off the floor, Lim Ju-kyung!

29:20.925 --> 29:21.760
Lim Ju-kyung?

29:28.725 --> 29:31.811
You look better now
than when you were getting dialysis.

29:31.895 --> 29:34.647
I met a good doctor,
and the surgery went well.

29:34.731 --> 29:35.607
I was lucky.

29:36.191 --> 29:37.859
That's so great.

29:37.942 --> 29:41.529
- Have you been well?
- Of course, I've been well.

29:43.907 --> 29:44.949
This is crazy.

29:49.370 --> 29:50.205
Mom,

29:50.914 --> 29:51.915
I'm going home.

29:52.540 --> 29:55.376
You'll scare the whole town at this hour.
Go wash your face.

30:01.841 --> 30:04.761
I have to reapply my makeup at this hour.

30:55.728 --> 30:58.314
You are so pretty, Ju-kyung.
I bet you're very popular.

30:59.649 --> 31:03.486
You two must be close
since you are in the same class.

31:06.072 --> 31:08.199
No, not really.

31:09.617 --> 31:11.953
Well, they can get to know
each other better now.

31:12.036 --> 31:14.831
You two are what they call
"model children."

31:16.624 --> 31:19.711
Now that we've met,
why don't you come over tomorrow?

31:19.794 --> 31:21.504
I'll make a nice dinner for you.

31:22.422 --> 31:24.048
Mom, I have a study group tomorrow.

31:25.049 --> 31:26.718
I heard she's going on a blind date.

31:27.302 --> 31:29.679
You're too young to go on a blind date!

31:30.263 --> 31:33.141
That's why you nagged me
to give you a facial.

31:33.224 --> 31:36.477
What's wrong with that?
They're at a good age to try out dating.

31:36.561 --> 31:39.439
It would be nice for Seo-jun
to get a girlfriend,

31:39.522 --> 31:41.232
but all he does is ride his motorcycle.

31:42.442 --> 31:44.402
He hasn't lately though.

31:45.153 --> 31:46.696
He rides it every day.

31:46.779 --> 31:48.072
- He totally--
- Hey!

31:49.490 --> 31:52.744
He totally drives too fast.
I almost got hit once.

31:52.827 --> 31:55.288
Is that right? You promised you wouldn't.

31:55.371 --> 31:58.541
I mean, I already own it.
And I'm saving on bus fare.

31:58.625 --> 32:00.460
He acts tough all the time,

32:00.543 --> 32:02.587
but he's just like Ju-young with his mom.

32:02.670 --> 32:04.464
You're not to be trusted, Han Seo-jun.

32:04.547 --> 32:06.799
Ju-kyung, please do me a favor.

32:07.675 --> 32:10.511
Make sure he doesn't ride his motorcycle.

32:10.595 --> 32:13.890
Let me know if you ever
see him riding it, okay?

32:14.515 --> 32:16.643
Mom, why would you ask such a thing?

32:16.726 --> 32:18.561
Trying to break your promise again?

32:20.647 --> 32:23.691
- You'll do that for me, won't you?
- Of course.

32:24.525 --> 32:25.902
You can count on me.

32:31.115 --> 32:32.408
BEAUTY SALON

32:32.492 --> 32:35.078
I can't come here
without makeup from now on.

32:35.787 --> 32:37.080
I almost got caught.

32:38.706 --> 32:39.540
Hey, you!

32:42.502 --> 32:44.963
You'll pay for it
if you say a word to my mom.

32:45.046 --> 32:46.130
About…

32:46.214 --> 32:47.465
about what?

32:47.548 --> 32:48.549
Your motorcycle?

32:50.885 --> 32:53.763
- Well, I made a promise to her so--
- And?

32:55.598 --> 32:57.809
And? What else is there?

32:59.686 --> 33:02.188
- How you were getting beaten up by--
- What?

33:03.439 --> 33:05.024
If that's not it…

33:05.692 --> 33:09.112
what else did you do wrong?

33:11.614 --> 33:13.866
How you almost got into trouble
for hitting Soo-ho?

33:19.247 --> 33:20.999
I won't.

33:22.458 --> 33:24.293
I'm good at keeping secrets.

33:32.176 --> 33:33.803
What a troublemaker.

33:39.559 --> 33:41.144
This is still funny to look at.

33:51.612 --> 33:53.031
When you're on a blind date,

33:53.114 --> 33:56.534
it's hard to check yourself in the mirror
with a guy in front of you.

33:57.285 --> 33:59.203
Some might think,

33:59.287 --> 34:01.539
"Should I try on a shade
I don't normally use?"

34:02.290 --> 34:04.459
"I should try something unique,"

34:04.542 --> 34:07.420
before going on a blind date.

34:08.588 --> 34:10.548
Hey, you over there!

34:11.132 --> 34:12.550
Don't use that shade!

34:12.633 --> 34:14.177
Please keep your hands away.

34:14.260 --> 34:17.221
Hey Seluvies, please remember…

34:17.305 --> 34:19.140
I tried on a new eyeshadow.

34:19.223 --> 34:21.225
If you try out a new shade or a new style,

34:21.309 --> 34:24.395
it might look awkward,
and things can even turn out wrong.

34:25.104 --> 34:27.398
Please stick to
your normal makeup routine.

34:27.482 --> 34:30.777
The key points here are
to focus on the details

34:30.860 --> 34:34.322
and heighten your loveliness.

34:51.631 --> 34:53.841
I heard so many good things
about you, Wu-hyun.

34:55.301 --> 34:57.678
Wu-hyun? Maybe that's too much.

34:59.138 --> 35:00.014
Mr. Ji?

35:01.557 --> 35:02.809
That doesn't sound right.

35:03.601 --> 35:04.602
How do I address him?

35:50.565 --> 35:52.567
Everything looks the same.

35:55.278 --> 35:58.531
Wait, isn't this what Mom ordered for her?

36:00.658 --> 36:02.785
I'll get you, you little punk.

36:11.919 --> 36:13.421
It even still has the tag.

36:20.261 --> 36:21.721
MATH OLYMPIAD

36:22.722 --> 36:24.432
What? He's really good-looking.

36:25.600 --> 36:26.601
He's so dreamy!

36:26.684 --> 36:28.394
- Really handsome.
- Hey, Soo-ho.

36:29.353 --> 36:30.438
Are you prepared?

36:31.189 --> 36:32.356
What's there to prepare?

36:32.440 --> 36:33.274
How obnoxious.

36:33.357 --> 36:35.860
Don't pretend you haven't studied
when you're going to ace it.

36:37.236 --> 36:39.280
Don't you get tired of
repeating that line?

36:39.363 --> 36:43.868
My family's always curious about
your results as much as mine.

36:44.452 --> 36:46.078
I'm here. Good luck.

36:46.162 --> 36:47.246
Good luck to you too.

36:47.330 --> 36:48.164
Hey, wait.

36:48.956 --> 36:51.584
Don't do better than me.
Just do a decent job, okay?

37:13.606 --> 37:14.899
I'm over by the windows.

37:29.205 --> 37:30.373
Hello.

37:30.456 --> 37:31.582
Nice to meet you.

37:31.666 --> 37:33.542
- Please take a seat.
- Thanks.

37:35.503 --> 37:38.172
You look prettier in person.
I almost didn't recognize you.

37:38.756 --> 37:40.132
I doubt that.

37:40.216 --> 37:41.300
I'm serious.

37:42.802 --> 37:44.345
Can I drop the honorifics?

37:44.428 --> 37:45.638
Of course, please.

37:45.721 --> 37:48.057
What would you like?
This place has nice bubble tea.

37:48.140 --> 37:49.475
Yes, I like it.

37:50.393 --> 37:52.770
You caught me off guard.
Are you being forward?

37:54.689 --> 37:55.523
I meant…

37:56.023 --> 37:58.359
I like bubble tea.

37:58.985 --> 38:00.194
I'm kidding.

38:18.879 --> 38:20.256
Welcome.

38:20.339 --> 38:22.466
- One popcorn and two cokes, please.
- Okay.

38:22.550 --> 38:25.052
I'll get these. You paid for the tickets.

38:26.095 --> 38:27.763
It's our first date, so I'll get it.

38:27.847 --> 38:30.349
That way, I get to ask you out again.

38:30.933 --> 38:31.767
Again?

38:32.435 --> 38:33.936
Does he want to meet again?

38:34.020 --> 38:35.479
Here's your popcorn.

38:36.522 --> 38:37.815
So sweaty.

39:16.520 --> 39:17.730
That was quick.

39:18.856 --> 39:20.483
Maybe you don't have any customers?

39:27.365 --> 39:29.033
It's not your fault.

39:45.049 --> 39:45.925
That dirty bastard.

39:55.226 --> 39:57.895
- What the heck?
- Sir, get out of the way.

39:57.978 --> 40:00.398
Sir, you're blocking the screen.

40:00.481 --> 40:01.649
Who the heck are you?

40:02.817 --> 40:03.901
Do you know him?

40:04.485 --> 40:07.196
No. How could I possibly
know a guy like this?

40:07.696 --> 40:08.531
I'm sorry.

40:12.326 --> 40:15.913
Gosh, I don't have time for this. Ha-ru!

40:16.831 --> 40:17.790
Eun Dan-oh.

40:18.499 --> 40:19.542
Eun Dan-oh!

40:28.467 --> 40:29.760
What are you doing?

40:30.970 --> 40:31.804
Get off me!

40:32.721 --> 40:34.640
Who the heck are you?

40:38.602 --> 40:39.979
I'd like to walk you home,

40:40.062 --> 40:42.064
but I have a meeting back on campus.

40:42.648 --> 40:43.482
Sorry.

40:44.191 --> 40:45.943
It's all right. You should get going.

40:46.026 --> 40:46.986
Thanks.

40:47.820 --> 40:50.698
- You'll go out with me again, right?
- What?

40:54.618 --> 40:55.453
Sure.

40:56.495 --> 40:57.830
Was I being too forward?

40:58.789 --> 40:59.790
I'll text you later.

41:01.167 --> 41:02.042
Get home safe.

41:05.254 --> 41:06.213
I will.

41:07.131 --> 41:08.174
Goodbye.

41:22.480 --> 41:23.856
This is so lame.

41:25.065 --> 41:26.484
What am I doing?

41:29.028 --> 41:30.237
Hey, babe. Where are you?

41:31.322 --> 41:32.490
I'm already here.

41:33.282 --> 41:35.701
Ta-da! Hey, babe.

41:35.784 --> 41:38.078
- When did you get here?
- Were you waiting long?

41:38.162 --> 41:40.414
I wanted to see you faster,
so I got here early.

41:41.040 --> 41:42.082
Let's go.

41:45.961 --> 41:46.837
MY FRIEND SU-AH

41:46.921 --> 41:48.172
How was it? Is he handsome?

41:48.255 --> 41:50.633
What did you eat?
What's he like? Seeing him again?

41:50.716 --> 41:51.675
So many questions.

41:51.759 --> 41:53.177
He asked me on a second date.

41:54.178 --> 41:55.888
Is this going somewhere?

41:58.682 --> 42:01.393
Did you get home? I miss you already.

42:07.149 --> 42:08.901
Gosh, he texted me. What do I say?

42:08.984 --> 42:11.070
- How should I answer?
- Hey, calm down.

42:11.153 --> 42:13.989
Don't answer right away.
Answer after a long while.

42:14.073 --> 42:16.700
How could I?
Being left on read might offend him.

42:16.784 --> 42:19.537
Don't even look at your phone.
Play hard to get.

42:20.287 --> 42:21.330
"Play hard to get"?

42:22.248 --> 42:24.041
This doesn't hurt and feels good?

42:24.124 --> 42:25.042
Yes.

42:26.585 --> 42:27.795
Does it feel good?

42:27.878 --> 42:29.296
Yes. It feels great.

42:29.380 --> 42:31.674
You're still not calling me?

42:31.757 --> 42:33.801
Should I just storm into his school?

42:33.884 --> 42:36.053
- I'm home!
- You're back.

42:36.136 --> 42:37.972
That looks yummy!

42:38.055 --> 42:41.267
Where have you been, all dolled up?

42:41.350 --> 42:42.643
Hey, that dress.

42:43.394 --> 42:44.478
This is…

42:45.104 --> 42:47.565
Is that new? It's pretty!

42:49.275 --> 42:50.109
Thanks.

42:50.651 --> 42:53.070
Are you coming from your blind date?

42:53.153 --> 42:55.656
You naughty girl, already going on dates.

42:55.739 --> 42:56.699
A date?

42:56.782 --> 42:59.493
Mom, Su-ah said,

42:59.577 --> 43:02.079
"You can postpone studying,
but never falling in love."

43:02.162 --> 43:04.582
That's the most ridiculous thing
I've ever heard.

43:04.665 --> 43:06.125
If you study hard and go to college,

43:06.208 --> 43:09.587
I would hook you up
with a nice guy like Seo-jun.

43:09.670 --> 43:11.630
- Seo-jun?
- He's a total delinquent.

43:11.714 --> 43:14.300
A delinquent?
Ju-kyung, don't meet a guy like that.

43:14.383 --> 43:17.886
What are you talking about?
He's such a good boy.

43:17.970 --> 43:21.056
When his mom was on the mend
after her kidney transplant,

43:21.140 --> 43:23.100
he took care of her for months.

43:23.183 --> 43:25.561
He worked part-time jobs
to cover his own tuition.

43:25.644 --> 43:28.647
- He even helped with the hospital bills.
- Really?

43:28.731 --> 43:31.567
He'd be perfect
if he didn't ride that motorcycle of his.

43:31.650 --> 43:34.069
Mi-hyang seemed awfully worried.

43:35.571 --> 43:38.490
Her husband actually passed away
in a traffic accident.

43:41.577 --> 43:43.579
Don't mention this to Seo-jun.

43:43.662 --> 43:45.080
- Really?
- Yes.

43:45.748 --> 43:48.083
If he's such a good boy,
why won't he listen to his mom?

43:54.089 --> 43:56.008
- Hello?
- Congratulations!

43:56.091 --> 43:58.886
- Darn it. This isn't the call I wanted.
- You can take out a loan…

43:58.969 --> 44:02.139
You voice-phishing scammers,
I'll take out your lives instead!

44:04.475 --> 44:05.351
It's infuriating.

44:05.434 --> 44:06.560
Hey, give me that.

44:07.353 --> 44:08.354
Jeez.

44:18.238 --> 44:19.823
I'm losing more and more.

44:21.742 --> 44:22.826
Mona Lisa,

44:23.744 --> 44:25.537
I share your pain.

44:35.506 --> 44:37.132
If we get another spark,

44:38.258 --> 44:39.301
we'll start dating, okay?

44:45.140 --> 44:45.974
LIM HEE-KYUNG

44:46.058 --> 44:46.892
Right,

44:47.518 --> 44:49.687
she asked me to treat her to dinner.

45:10.290 --> 45:11.875
It feels refreshing.

45:14.837 --> 45:16.547
Hey, you got something good going on?

45:17.047 --> 45:18.173
Did someone ask you out?

45:19.091 --> 45:20.926
- Actually…
- Yes?

45:23.053 --> 45:24.430
I went on a blind date.

45:25.931 --> 45:27.933
I think it went well.

45:28.016 --> 45:30.686
Look at you,
all grown up and going on a date.

45:30.769 --> 45:32.813
All thanks to my makeup skills.

45:33.689 --> 45:34.606
- Hee-kyung.
- Yes?

45:34.690 --> 45:36.984
When should I reply
if I'm playing hard to get?

45:37.067 --> 45:39.194
Su-ah said to answer after a long while.

45:39.278 --> 45:40.612
It's been 30 minutes now.

45:41.864 --> 45:43.907
I don't play games.
I like it straightforward.

45:44.491 --> 45:46.076
Don't keep him waiting. Text him back.

45:46.160 --> 45:47.494
- Right?
- Right.

45:51.248 --> 45:52.958
Forget what I said about missing you.

45:53.041 --> 45:55.210
I actually have a girlfriend.

45:55.294 --> 45:57.546
I'm a bastard for trying to cheat
on her with you.

45:57.629 --> 45:58.630
I sincerely apologize.

45:58.714 --> 45:59.548
What's he saying?

46:00.757 --> 46:03.010
You got dumped. But who does it like this?

46:03.093 --> 46:03.927
I…

46:05.345 --> 46:06.263
I got dumped?

46:06.346 --> 46:07.181
I mean,

46:07.681 --> 46:10.559
if he doesn't like you,
he could leave it as "not meant to be."

46:10.642 --> 46:11.643
Not meant to be…

46:11.727 --> 46:13.187
He's a total jerk.

46:13.270 --> 46:14.313
I see.

46:15.397 --> 46:17.232
I got dumped.

46:18.192 --> 46:19.401
Of course, I did.

46:20.277 --> 46:22.404
How could I get a guy with this face?

46:23.030 --> 46:25.699
It's hard to find the one on a blind date.

46:25.782 --> 46:27.326
Forget about it, okay?

46:31.038 --> 46:32.623
There you are.

46:34.124 --> 46:36.668
"Hello, you told me to buy you a meal,

46:36.752 --> 46:40.964
but I didn't want to impose on you
and take your valuable time."

46:41.048 --> 46:43.217
"I'll wire you a sum for compensation."

46:43.300 --> 46:45.302
"Kindly let me know
your bank account info."

46:45.385 --> 46:46.386
What account info?

46:46.470 --> 46:47.679
You got dumped.

46:49.598 --> 46:50.557
Dumped?

46:51.934 --> 46:53.060
He dumped me?

46:55.771 --> 46:57.940
No guy has ever treated me this way.

46:58.857 --> 47:00.943
You can still get dumped
with that pretty face?

47:03.028 --> 47:06.365
How much prettier do I have to be, then?

47:06.448 --> 47:07.449
Come on, you two.

47:07.533 --> 47:09.493
Why are you fussing
when I'm trying to poop?

47:10.160 --> 47:11.286
Get out!

47:16.625 --> 47:19.920
So embarrassing.
How do I tell Su-ah that I got dumped?

47:23.924 --> 47:25.050
Caught in the act.

47:28.095 --> 47:31.807
- What do you think you're doing?
- Your mom did ask me to report to her.

47:31.890 --> 47:33.392
This is ridiculous.

47:33.475 --> 47:35.769
You should listen to your mother.

47:35.852 --> 47:37.020
Are you my mom's Mafia?

47:37.980 --> 47:39.982
"Mafia"? More like her spy.

47:40.065 --> 47:41.275
Same difference!

47:41.358 --> 47:42.985
They're both bad guys, aren't they?

47:47.322 --> 47:50.325
You're not the only person with leverage.
I have something too.

47:53.078 --> 47:54.663
Delete it when I ask nicely.

47:54.746 --> 47:56.540
Hey, Han Seo-jun!

47:56.623 --> 47:59.376
- Seo-jun, delete it.
- You delete it first.

47:59.459 --> 48:00.627
I said, delete it!

48:06.258 --> 48:08.260
I've just wasted so much energy.

48:12.931 --> 48:14.600
Trying to face-stamp my jacket again?

48:19.980 --> 48:21.231
Don't get off track.

48:22.024 --> 48:22.899
What?

48:24.443 --> 48:25.902
Watch where you're going.

48:25.986 --> 48:28.238
- You should study instead--
- There you go again.

48:28.322 --> 48:29.364
I memorized them all.

48:29.448 --> 48:31.867
Tae, Jeong, Tae, Se, Mun, Dan, Se
Ye, Seong, Yeon, Chung, In, Myeong, Seon

48:31.950 --> 48:33.869
Kwang, In, Hyo, Hyeon, Su, Gyeong, Yeong
Jeong, Sun, Heon, Cheol, Go, Sun

48:40.500 --> 48:41.793
Let's see.

48:45.964 --> 48:47.758
- Babe.
- Yes?

48:48.717 --> 48:50.385
Aren't you going to edit my face?

48:50.469 --> 48:52.387
Don't stand so close when we take selfies.

48:52.471 --> 48:54.264
It makes it obvious I edited the photo.

48:56.141 --> 48:58.060
It's as if I'm dating two different girls.

48:58.894 --> 49:01.271
The Su-ah in front of me
and the Su-ah on Newstagram.

49:03.398 --> 49:06.652
Then why don't you break up with me
and date her over DM?

49:06.735 --> 49:08.028
That's not what I meant.

49:08.612 --> 49:11.281
How could I break up with you
when you're this cute?

49:16.703 --> 49:18.330
Ju-kyung, our girl in love.

49:18.413 --> 49:20.832
It's not like that.

49:20.916 --> 49:22.501
Why? You said you'd see him again.

49:22.584 --> 49:23.794
I thought it went well.

49:25.087 --> 49:29.132
- Well, I got a message after we texted.
- Okay.

49:30.258 --> 49:31.259
It turns out…

49:32.678 --> 49:34.388
he's a weird guy.

49:34.471 --> 49:36.348
Why? What did he say? Let me see.

49:39.518 --> 49:40.352
Here.

49:42.229 --> 49:46.483
"Forget what I said about missing you.
I actually have a girlfriend."

49:46.566 --> 49:48.819
"I'm a bastard for trying to cheat
on her with you."

49:49.403 --> 49:50.654
"I sincerely apologize."

49:51.488 --> 49:53.323
- What's with him?
- Did you get dumped?

49:54.616 --> 49:56.576
- Already?
- How do you get dumped right away?

49:56.660 --> 49:58.620
- That was faster than a 5G connection.
- Seriously?

49:58.704 --> 49:59.871
Love isn't easy.

50:00.914 --> 50:02.624
- The heart changes fast.
- It does.

50:04.543 --> 50:05.627
The high schooler?

50:06.169 --> 50:07.003
Well…

50:07.671 --> 50:08.880
Her body isn't impressive,

50:09.548 --> 50:10.966
but her face isn't so bad.

50:11.758 --> 50:13.760
And she's kind of naive,

50:13.844 --> 50:15.762
so it'll be easy to get her.

50:17.514 --> 50:19.433
She's good for a short fling.

50:20.892 --> 50:22.102
Who the heck are you?

50:22.769 --> 50:24.771
- Hold on.
- Take that back.

50:25.355 --> 50:26.815
I take it back.

50:26.898 --> 50:28.775
Whatever I said,

50:28.859 --> 50:30.110
I take it back, all right?

50:30.193 --> 50:31.069
So let me go.

50:31.653 --> 50:32.696
PARK SUNG-NYUNG

50:33.613 --> 50:34.740
THIRD AUNT
DID YOU GET HOME? I MISS YOU ALREADY.

50:34.823 --> 50:36.283
Who do you think you are?

50:36.366 --> 50:37.200
Wait.

50:38.702 --> 50:40.704
It hurts.
My arms get habitually dislocated.

50:40.787 --> 50:41.913
Bastard.

50:47.252 --> 50:48.378
Ta-da!

50:50.422 --> 50:51.465
It's amazing.

50:57.637 --> 51:00.098
What's that?
Is he showing them my picture?

51:01.808 --> 51:04.102
- It looks like nose hair.
- Is it really nose hair?

51:04.186 --> 51:05.228
- Enlarge it!
- No, wait.

51:05.312 --> 51:06.938
- Is it?
- Look right here.

51:14.112 --> 51:15.280
What did I say?

51:15.906 --> 51:17.491
- Send this to the group chat.
- Hey!

51:18.617 --> 51:20.786
- Come on.
- What is she doing?

51:20.869 --> 51:22.329
- Hey, Ju-kyung!
- That hurts!

51:23.789 --> 51:24.623
Hey, stop!

51:24.706 --> 51:25.791
Ju-kyung!

51:25.874 --> 51:28.001
Bring it back when I say it nicely.
Come here!

51:28.084 --> 51:29.836
I saw it all. Come on. Bring it here!

51:33.131 --> 51:35.091
- Hand it over.
- What do you mean?

51:36.468 --> 51:37.677
I saw everything, okay?

51:40.680 --> 51:41.765
Why are you jumping in?

51:42.349 --> 51:43.391
What are you doing?

51:51.441 --> 51:53.735
You're starting up a fight again, right?

51:58.824 --> 52:00.200
Please don't, okay?

52:00.283 --> 52:02.285
Here, here's your key.
I'll give this back.

52:02.369 --> 52:04.037
Let's part ways. You, go this way.

52:04.120 --> 52:07.374
And you, that way. Let's go.
I'm going this way.

52:16.216 --> 52:18.552
Our teacher is really good,
so listen carefully.

52:18.635 --> 52:21.263
Will I be able to not give up on math?

52:21.346 --> 52:23.974
Hey, you can do it too.

52:24.057 --> 52:25.058
Don't give up.

52:25.141 --> 52:26.226
You and me.

52:27.102 --> 52:28.186
All right.

52:28.270 --> 52:29.145
Hey, Kangsu.

52:29.229 --> 52:32.232
Can I bring my friend
from Shinhwa Boys' High School?

52:32.941 --> 52:34.651
Shinhwa Boys' High School?

52:34.734 --> 52:35.986
What kind of friend is he?

52:36.069 --> 52:38.989
I have so many questions
I would like to ask.

52:39.072 --> 52:40.490
Why bring a guy we don't know?

52:40.574 --> 52:42.659
You know why. So Ju-kyung can get a guy.

52:42.742 --> 52:45.787
Dating is a must
Marriage is an option

52:45.871 --> 52:47.247
Amor Fati

52:59.634 --> 53:01.511
What? You said you wouldn't join us.

53:01.595 --> 53:03.930
I said I didn't want to.
I never said I wouldn't.

53:06.308 --> 53:09.185
Our study group has
the top two students in our school.

53:10.145 --> 53:11.855
We're like the Avengers, right?

53:23.575 --> 53:25.452
How can you not know this basic concept?

53:27.203 --> 53:29.331
I don't know the basics.

53:33.668 --> 53:35.253
When limit n approaches infinity,

53:35.337 --> 53:37.547
n over n squared is reduced,
becoming one over n.

53:37.631 --> 53:40.050
The limit is zero. In contrast,

53:40.884 --> 53:43.553
n squared over n will be reduced to n.

53:43.637 --> 53:46.056
As such, it will diverge to infinity.

53:53.980 --> 53:54.981
What?

53:55.065 --> 53:58.234
How does your tiny head
solve such difficult questions?

53:58.944 --> 54:00.779
What's your IQ? Is it over 150?

54:00.862 --> 54:02.697
How can you not focus even for a moment?

54:03.657 --> 54:05.075
You have a two-digit IQ, right?

54:05.158 --> 54:07.243
- FYI, dolphins have an IQ of 80.
- They're that smart?

54:07.327 --> 54:08.745
Work harder if you want to beat them.

54:12.040 --> 54:13.041
Focus.

54:17.253 --> 54:18.338
So what's the answer?

54:36.231 --> 54:37.399
Lucky her.

54:39.192 --> 54:42.278
By the way, when did you get
so close with Soo-ho?

54:42.362 --> 54:44.781
He's not the type to tutor anyone.

54:45.448 --> 54:46.616
This is being close?

54:48.159 --> 54:48.994
By his standards.

54:49.577 --> 54:50.412
Well…

54:53.498 --> 54:54.958
I'm not really sure.

54:55.917 --> 54:58.837
Maybe he's helping me out
because I'm so hopeless at math.

55:01.214 --> 55:02.799
What a show-off.

55:07.429 --> 55:09.973
Guys, to mark our first study session…

55:10.974 --> 55:13.184
- Want to go to coin karaoke?
- Yes!

55:14.227 --> 55:15.311
You had it all planned, right?

55:17.856 --> 55:19.441
You're not coming, are you, Soo-ho?

55:20.859 --> 55:22.402
I can go for a little bit.

55:25.405 --> 55:28.700
- Real, you're so real
- Real, you're so real

55:28.783 --> 55:31.786
- You're the real deal
- You're the real deal

55:31.870 --> 55:34.789
- The real deal has arrived
- The real deal has arrived

55:34.873 --> 55:35.790
- Right now
- Right now

55:38.251 --> 55:41.254
- Real, you're so real
- Real, you're so real

55:41.337 --> 55:44.174
- You're the real deal
- You're the real deal

55:44.799 --> 55:48.386
- I'm really going to love you
- I'm really going to love you

55:48.470 --> 55:50.972
- Cheer up, baby
- Cheer up, baby

55:51.056 --> 55:53.058
- You can do it
- You can do it

55:53.600 --> 55:56.644
- A girl can't give her heart too easily
- A girl can't give her heart too easily

55:56.728 --> 55:58.480
- Then you'll like me more
- Then you'll like me more

55:58.563 --> 56:01.649
No, I'm okay
Don't feel pressured

56:01.733 --> 56:05.320
I don't have a boyfriend anyways

56:05.403 --> 56:08.406
- But why don't you say anything
- Say anything

56:08.490 --> 56:11.367
- When I look at you
- When I look at you

56:11.451 --> 56:15.246
- When I look at you again
- When I look at you again

56:15.330 --> 56:18.708
- I'm so cold I shiver, naengmyeon
- I'm so cold I shiver, naengmyeon

56:18.792 --> 56:22.629
- So chewy, naengmyeon
- So chewy, naengmyeon

56:22.712 --> 56:24.589
- But I still love you
- But I still love you

56:24.672 --> 56:28.051
- Nice!
- Hey, fire, fire, my lady

56:28.134 --> 56:31.721
Hey, hey, warning, warning, no, no

56:31.805 --> 56:33.723
Hey, hey, fire…

56:39.395 --> 56:40.855
Sometimes

56:42.232 --> 56:44.734
I live and forget

56:45.485 --> 56:47.445
Pretending I'm fine

56:48.113 --> 56:51.616
I even meet with people…

56:52.492 --> 56:53.743
He sings really well.

56:54.285 --> 56:56.121
He could totally be a singer.

56:58.248 --> 57:00.667
I think I've heard this song before.

57:02.418 --> 57:03.711
Where have I heard this?

57:09.050 --> 57:12.137
How are you doing?

57:12.220 --> 57:17.892
I guess I'm not doing well

57:22.480 --> 57:24.107
I must have been away too long.

57:24.190 --> 57:25.942
I see a lot of new faces.

57:26.025 --> 57:28.862
- You look more handsome in person.
- You look amazing.

57:28.945 --> 57:30.822
To learn the new staff members' faces,

57:30.905 --> 57:32.115
we'll need a staff dinner.

57:33.450 --> 57:34.451
Please have a seat.

57:34.534 --> 57:36.661
- Shall we start the meeting?
- Yes.

57:36.744 --> 57:39.581
THE LATE JEONG SE-YEON TRIBUTE PROJECT

57:39.664 --> 57:42.500
As the first anniversary
of Jeong Se-yeon's passing approaches,

57:42.584 --> 57:45.128
I propose a tribute album.
Considering the circumstances,

57:45.211 --> 57:48.423
I think consoling the fans and the members
with a tribute album

57:48.506 --> 57:54.262
takes priority over a grand comeback
of NSIX without Se-yeon.

57:55.138 --> 57:58.641
I found this song
from the files Se-yeon left behind.

57:58.725 --> 58:00.393
Se-yeon wrote the lyrics,

58:00.477 --> 58:03.104
and someone called Leo composed it.

58:04.022 --> 58:05.148
I love the song.

58:06.441 --> 58:07.734
Leo, was it?

58:08.276 --> 58:09.235
Yes.

58:09.319 --> 58:12.614
We don't know who it is yet,
so we are on the lookout for Leo.

58:13.198 --> 58:14.157
I see.

58:24.334 --> 58:26.169
Isn't that Seo-jun's motorcycle?

58:28.755 --> 58:30.173
Is he nearby?

58:34.802 --> 58:35.637
It is his.

58:36.304 --> 58:39.307
He's been riding the motorcycle again.

58:39.390 --> 58:40.892
Seriously, why ride a motorcycle?

58:41.976 --> 58:43.019
Seo-jun,

58:43.102 --> 58:46.022
I'm going to break this motorcycle.

58:46.731 --> 58:47.649
What are you doing?

58:50.193 --> 58:52.237
I'm not doing anything.

58:53.488 --> 58:54.531
Did you do something?

58:54.614 --> 58:55.865
I didn't even touch it.

58:56.908 --> 58:57.825
Come on.

59:02.664 --> 59:05.458
- Come over here for a moment.
- What is it?

59:11.339 --> 59:12.340
What was that for?

59:12.966 --> 59:15.885
Why don't we talk here?

59:17.303 --> 59:18.429
It has to be in secret?

59:18.513 --> 59:19.639
Yes.

59:20.723 --> 59:22.934
Hey, Han Seo-jun!

59:26.229 --> 59:29.440
- Why are you coming from there?
- What do you mean, why?

59:30.275 --> 59:31.651
You crazy punk.

59:33.736 --> 59:34.904
Hey.

59:34.988 --> 59:36.781
Why did he have to show up here?

59:38.074 --> 59:39.033
Who's this?

59:39.117 --> 59:41.452
Why did you bring a girl
to this back alley?

59:42.453 --> 59:43.621
You should take off.

59:45.290 --> 59:46.291
What do I do?

59:50.712 --> 59:52.130
Get them.

59:52.213 --> 59:53.965
- Get them!
- Come on!

59:54.048 --> 59:56.759
- Stop!
- Hurry up!

01:00:05.643 --> 01:00:07.645
- I said stop!
- Stop right there!

01:00:25.079 --> 01:00:26.122
Hurry up.

01:00:26.205 --> 01:00:27.248
Are you serious?

01:00:30.168 --> 01:00:31.336
- Stop!
- Hey.

01:00:31.419 --> 01:00:32.837
I said stop!

01:00:32.920 --> 01:00:35.006
- How far are they going?
- They're getting away.

01:00:47.518 --> 01:00:48.353
Quickly!

01:00:49.437 --> 01:00:51.356
- Where did they go?
- Must be over there.

01:00:59.447 --> 01:01:01.240
- What's this?
- What the…

01:01:07.163 --> 01:01:07.997
Who's this?

01:01:08.623 --> 01:01:09.957
This guy is from Saebom High.

01:01:24.555 --> 01:01:25.515
They left.

01:01:25.598 --> 01:01:26.641
They're gone.

01:01:28.101 --> 01:01:30.645
Why would you drag me here
when I told you to take off?

01:01:30.728 --> 01:01:32.730
What would they think?

01:01:35.566 --> 01:01:36.734
What would they think?

01:01:36.818 --> 01:01:39.612
Wouldn't it look suspicious
if I took off like that?

01:01:40.613 --> 01:01:42.323
Gosh, you're so dumb.

01:01:43.116 --> 01:01:45.201
I just saved you. And what? I'm dumb?

01:01:45.284 --> 01:01:47.537
Do you know who comes after King Sejong?

01:01:47.620 --> 01:01:50.331
- King Gojong.
- You've skipped 400 years.

01:01:50.415 --> 01:01:52.041
- Look who's dumber.
- What?

01:01:53.668 --> 01:01:56.045
Who are you? Why did you follow us?

01:01:59.215 --> 01:02:01.676
- Where do you think you're going?
- You a friend of Seo-jun's?

01:02:02.719 --> 01:02:04.220
Or his sidekick?

01:02:06.013 --> 01:02:06.848
Get out of my way.

01:02:07.432 --> 01:02:10.017
I'll let you go if you bring Seo-jun here.

01:02:11.936 --> 01:02:12.770
Why would I?

01:02:12.854 --> 01:02:14.272
If a friend gave him a call,

01:02:14.355 --> 01:02:16.274
he'd come, wouldn't he?

01:02:16.357 --> 01:02:17.608
He wouldn't take my call.

01:02:17.692 --> 01:02:18.860
Then let's find out.

01:02:19.652 --> 01:02:20.695
Take his phone.

01:02:21.362 --> 01:02:23.156
All right, excuse us.

01:02:24.824 --> 01:02:26.075
It's right here.

01:02:28.244 --> 01:02:29.370
You dare stop me?

01:02:30.496 --> 01:02:31.622
Let go.

01:02:33.958 --> 01:02:34.959
Seriously?

01:02:36.794 --> 01:02:38.755
- What are you doing?
- Get up.

01:02:38.838 --> 01:02:39.797
Where are you going?

01:02:39.881 --> 01:02:41.466
- Let go.
- Bring him here.

01:02:42.884 --> 01:02:43.760
This punk!

01:02:46.804 --> 01:02:49.766
- Hold him.
- I got him.

01:02:49.849 --> 01:02:51.768
- You go ahead.
- Shoot.

01:02:51.851 --> 01:02:52.977
- I'm sorry.
- You guys…

01:02:53.060 --> 01:02:53.978
Go high, I'll go low.

01:02:54.061 --> 01:02:55.354
- One, two, three.
- One, two, three.

01:02:59.150 --> 01:03:00.777
Let go!

01:03:03.780 --> 01:03:05.239
Get him.

01:03:07.283 --> 01:03:08.743
Hold him tight.

01:03:08.826 --> 01:03:10.328
Grab him. Hold still.

01:03:14.749 --> 01:03:16.334
How dare you mess with my crew?

01:03:18.252 --> 01:03:20.171
- What are you doing over there?
- Shoot.

01:03:20.254 --> 01:03:21.798
- Let's take off.
- Let's go.

01:03:37.146 --> 01:03:38.272
What?

01:03:38.356 --> 01:03:39.982
Can you lend me some money?

01:03:40.066 --> 01:03:41.442
Why would I?

01:03:41.526 --> 01:03:44.529
My friends went looking for me
and went home with my bag.

01:03:44.612 --> 01:03:46.614
My phone and wallet were both in the bag.

01:03:47.698 --> 01:03:48.950
Serves you right.

01:03:49.575 --> 01:03:51.953
I did save you,
so consider this as payback.

01:03:52.036 --> 01:03:54.497
Just lend me my bus fare. That's it.

01:03:54.580 --> 01:03:56.207
What payback?

01:03:56.290 --> 01:03:57.625
I won't. You can walk home.

01:04:00.044 --> 01:04:01.337
You're heartless.

01:04:10.847 --> 01:04:11.681
Hey.

01:04:14.225 --> 01:04:16.561
- Get on before I change my mind.
- Really?

01:04:17.687 --> 01:04:18.688
Thank you!

01:04:23.734 --> 01:04:24.944
How do I get on?

01:04:27.071 --> 01:04:28.322
Like this?

01:04:29.198 --> 01:04:30.199
Here we go.

01:04:45.923 --> 01:04:49.844
PRINCE COMICS

01:05:05.610 --> 01:05:06.861
Thank you.

01:05:08.195 --> 01:05:10.197
If you're so thankful, erase the picture.

01:05:12.867 --> 01:05:13.701
Ju-kyung.

01:05:20.207 --> 01:05:24.045
I went through all that to keep you apart.
Were you a couple in your past life?

01:05:25.379 --> 01:05:26.255
Soo-ho, you again?

01:05:26.339 --> 01:05:27.924
Why are you bringing her home?

01:05:28.007 --> 01:05:30.217
Look who's talking.
Why were you waiting for her?

01:05:34.680 --> 01:05:36.557
Okay, guys.

01:05:36.641 --> 01:05:38.559
Why don't we all head home?

01:05:38.643 --> 01:05:40.603
It's late. You head that way.

01:05:40.686 --> 01:05:42.730
And you go that way. Go in opposite--

01:05:46.317 --> 01:05:47.151
Hee-kyung!

01:05:49.654 --> 01:05:50.821
What's this?

01:05:52.031 --> 01:05:54.867
Why do we have two beautiful guys here?

01:05:58.955 --> 01:06:00.081
Did I die?

01:06:00.748 --> 01:06:02.083
Am I in heaven?

01:06:04.335 --> 01:06:05.503
Hee-kyung.

01:06:06.045 --> 01:06:06.879
Hee-kyung.

01:06:10.549 --> 01:06:12.093
Come with me.

01:06:12.176 --> 01:06:15.763
- I'll help you make it big!
- Hee-kyung.

01:06:18.432 --> 01:06:19.684
This is crazy.

01:06:19.767 --> 01:06:22.687
Come on. Wake up, okay?

01:06:24.271 --> 01:06:25.731
I'll kill you if you get sick.

01:06:26.857 --> 01:06:28.317
- Let's take her home.
- Hey.

01:06:28.401 --> 01:06:30.152
Why should I?

01:06:30.820 --> 01:06:31.988
Why should I…

01:06:32.697 --> 01:06:33.531
Jeez.

01:06:33.614 --> 01:06:36.075
Seriously, Hee-kyung,
when you wake up, I'm going to…

01:06:36.158 --> 01:06:38.119
Let's go.

01:06:38.202 --> 01:06:40.413
Cover her mouth.

01:06:46.794 --> 01:06:48.295
We're here. This is it.

01:06:49.171 --> 01:06:52.008
Thank you so much.
I'll be forever grateful to…

01:06:52.758 --> 01:06:53.676
No!

01:07:19.452 --> 01:07:21.871
I'm so sorry.
I will get it cleaned for you.

01:07:21.954 --> 01:07:24.081
No. I'll burn it and get you a new one.

01:07:24.165 --> 01:07:26.125
I'm really sorry. Good night.

01:07:41.932 --> 01:07:43.100
Hey, Soo-ho.

01:07:51.275 --> 01:07:52.818
Do you like Lim Ju-kyung?

01:07:54.904 --> 01:07:57.031
- What?
- Don't you like her?

01:08:00.951 --> 01:08:01.994
Then what about you?

01:08:02.787 --> 01:08:04.413
Why do you keep hanging around her?

01:08:07.750 --> 01:08:08.918
Do you like Lim Ju-kyung?

01:08:14.090 --> 01:08:15.382
Should I give it a try?

01:08:56.674 --> 01:08:57.633
EXAMINATION SLIP

01:09:12.022 --> 01:09:14.233
What is it? Where are you going?

01:09:32.168 --> 01:09:33.419
Do you like Lim Ju-kyung?

01:10:11.790 --> 01:10:12.791
Here, take it.

01:10:14.793 --> 01:10:15.669
What?

01:10:15.753 --> 01:10:17.004
You told me not to ride it.

01:10:18.631 --> 01:10:19.715
Are they dating?

01:10:21.884 --> 01:10:23.093
Starting today,

01:10:23.844 --> 01:10:25.054
I'll only listen to you.

01:10:30.142 --> 01:10:32.019
What was that? Was that a confession?

01:10:32.102 --> 01:10:34.146
Does Seo-jun like Ju-kyung?

01:10:34.730 --> 01:10:35.856
That's huge.

01:10:36.857 --> 01:10:38.442
Hey, Seo-jun!

01:10:38.525 --> 01:10:39.401
Don't go.

01:10:43.197 --> 01:10:45.115
- Just a--
- I said, don't go.

01:11:12.268 --> 01:11:14.603
THANK YOU TO KIM HYE-YOON AND LEE JAE-WOOK
FOR THEIR SPECIAL APPEARANCE

01:11:40.212 --> 01:11:41.547
You can sit here if you want.

01:11:41.630 --> 01:11:43.507
You're wearing a goddess mask.

01:11:43.590 --> 01:11:44.758
Bring the pork cutlets.

01:11:44.842 --> 01:11:46.468
Lee Soo-ho and Han Seo-jun?

01:11:46.552 --> 01:11:48.637
- Seriously, watch your mouth.
- What?

01:11:48.721 --> 01:11:51.849
- He only listens to her!
- He only listens to her!

01:11:54.226 --> 01:11:56.145
Don't run away because you're scared.

01:11:56.228 --> 01:11:57.855
What? Hey.

01:11:58.397 --> 01:12:00.482
It's all because of me,
and it's all my fault.

01:12:00.566 --> 01:12:03.152
But don't play Lim Ju-kyung.

01:12:03.861 --> 01:12:05.154
My gosh.

01:12:07.781 --> 01:12:12.786
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
